<title>USA: Northstar Health Services names CFO.</title>
<headline>Northstar Health Services names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANA, Pa. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northstar Health Services Inc said Monday it has named John Lombardi executive vice president, chief financial officer and treasurer.</p>
<p>He succeeds Lisa Guarino, who resigned to &quot;pursue her own interests,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Northstar, Lombardi was a senior manager in the Philadelphia office of Arthur Andersen LLP.</p>
